   364	/// The main trait for container screen handlers.
   365	///
   366	/// Screen handlers manage the server-side state of container UIs like chests,
   367	/// furnaces, crafting tables, etc. They handle:
   368	/// - Slot layout and management
   369	/// - Click processing
   370	/// - Item transfer logic (shift-click)
   371	/// - Client synchronization
   372	///
   373	/// # Implementation
   374	///
   375	/// Implementors must provide:
   376	/// - [`get_behaviour`](ScreenHandler::get_behaviour) and [`get_behaviour_mut`](ScreenHandler::get_behaviour_mut)
   377	/// - [`quick_move`](ScreenHandler::quick_move) for shift-click behavior
   378	/// - [`as_any`](ScreenHandler::as_any) for downcasting
   379	// ScreenHandler.java
   380	// TODO: Fully implement this
