     1	//! NBT Structure Template System
     2	//!
     3	//! This module provides functionality for loading and placing Minecraft structure
     4	//! templates from `.nbt` files. This enables exact vanilla structure matching and
     5	//! dramatically simplifies implementing structures like igloos, shipwrecks, villages, etc.
     6	//!
     7	//! # Architecture
     8	//!
     9	//! - [`StructureTemplate`]: Represents a loaded NBT template with size, palette, and blocks
    10	//! - [`TemplatePiece`]: A structure piece that places blocks from a template
    11	//! - [`Rotation`] and [`Mirror`]: Transform positions and block properties
    12	//! - [`TemplateCache`]: Lazy-loading cache for embedded template files
    13	//!
    14	//! # Example Usage
    15	//!
    16	//! ```ignore
    17	//! use pumpkin_world::generation::structure::template::{TemplateCache, TemplatePiece};
    18	//! use pumpkin_data::Rotation;
    19	//!
    20	//! // Load a template from the cache
    21	//! let template = TemplateCache::get("igloo/top").expect("Template not found");
    22	//!
    23	//! // Create a piece to place the template
    24	//! let piece = TemplatePiece::new(template, rotation, mirror, position);
    25	//! ```
