The live Wind Charge implementation already has the vanilla eye-height adjustment in `ThrownItemEntity::new`, so I’m not adding a duplicate spawn API. I’m shipping two concrete parity fixes on existing callers: award `ITEM_USED` in `normal_use`, and decrement the deflection cooldown with an atomic read-modify-write. I’ll add a small pure unit test for the cooldown helper, then record all classifications and grep evidence.
